>> Combination := Rondedzero nyowani.

Combination kana-zvasvika: ['wedzera-kumagumo:'] ita: { :el
	pachako 
	tsvaga: el, Hapana? chokwadi: { pachako wedzera-kumagumo: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination nyowani.
colours
	wedzera-kumagumo: ['red'],
	wedzera-kumagumo: ['green'],
	wedzera-kumagumo: ['blue'],
	wedzera-kumagumo: ['red'].

Zvabuda nyora: colours, mutsara-mutsva.
